138
00:09:13,441 --> 00:09:22,200
Horses spend a lot of training time learning to move large groups that may not be so inclined.

139
00:09:22,201 --> 00:09:28,320
Our goal here with the ball is it's a big solid object with many panels of color so

140
00:09:28,321 --> 00:09:31,700
there's a lot going on for the horse to look at.

141
00:09:31,701 --> 00:09:35,500
But we want to teach the horse that they can move something that looks solid.

142
00:09:35,501 --> 00:09:39,100
What this does is when we're faced with a massive crowd and they say, okay, we need

143
00:09:39,101 --> 00:09:43,000
