I can't move them.

145
00:09:44,381 --> 00:09:51,600
She's learned that she can use her body, not attack it, but just use her body to push something.

146
00:09:51,601 --> 00:09:57,920
Today law enforcement agencies in the United States maintain nearly 100 mounted units.

147
00:09:57,921 --> 00:10:01,000
Officers on the equine beat in Washington understand why.

148
00:10:01,001 --> 00:10:06,760
It's so rewarding when you see so many people coming up to you and thanking you for being

149
00:10:06,761 --> 00:10:11,660
