150
00:10:11,661 --> 00:10:13,980
They really enjoy seeing horses.

151
00:10:13,981 --> 00:10:18,060
The response that we get from the public is absolutely fabulous.

152
00:10:18,061 --> 00:10:22,360
And then when we have to patrol for things like big demonstrations and stuff like in

153
00:10:22,361 --> 00:10:26,400
front of the White House, we realize that we can provide a real good service so that

154
00:10:26,401 --> 00:10:31,280
people can exercise their First Amendment rights and do so safely.

155
00:10:31,281 --> 00:10:39,700
Horses working as cops on the beat continue to prove the value of animals over machines.

156
00:10:39,701 --> 00:10:43,520
That also holds true in America's forests.

