00:11:07,761 --> 00:11:15,280
We now return to the horse on Modern Marvels.

163
00:11:15,281 --> 00:11:20,400
War horses performed critical tasks for victorious armies.

164
00:11:20,401 --> 00:11:26,540
larger breeds of workhorses helped civilized newly conquered territories.

165
00:11:26,541 --> 00:11:32,040
Until the 9th century AD, oxen were the animals of choice as beasts of burden.

166
00:11:32,041 --> 00:11:38,480
But when the horse collar was invented to pull heavy loads, native Belgian draft horses

167
00:11:38,481 --> 00:11:44,360
