169
00:11:45,361 --> 00:11:48,720
I think the English Shires are one of the most handsome breeds.

170
00:11:48,721 --> 00:11:53,720
You notice all the large feathering on their legs, and that was for protection.

171
00:11:53,721 --> 00:12:01,720
During the evolutionary process, this type of horse was in the western European mountains,

172
00:12:01,721 --> 00:12:05,720
and so they had to be thick, they had to be heavy, and they had to be rugged.

173
00:12:05,721 --> 00:12:11,720
He has a great deal of mass and weight so that he could be very efficient.

174
00:12:11,721 --> 00:12:13,720
