222
00:15:43,180 --> 00:15:48,220
The same steam and gasoline revolution that retired city workhorses also decreased the need

223
00:15:48,221 --> 00:15:52,780
for their country cousins. Today, most major logging companies use heavy machinery.

224
00:15:52,781 --> 00:15:57,160
But many smaller companies in the U.S., Canada, and the United Kingdom

225
00:15:57,161 --> 00:16:00,160
happily continue to use real horsepower,

226
00:16:01,240 --> 00:16:03,780
especially with the uncertain cost of fuel.

227
00:16:05,400 --> 00:16:08,640
They cost me about $2.50 a horse per day,

228
00:16:09,300 --> 00:16:11,660
